<html><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1"><title>Falun Gong Human Rights Newsletter, Issue 30</title></head><body>
<table border=0 cellpadding=0 ALIGN="CENTER" bgcolor="white" bordercolorlight="#d6d3e4" bordercolordark="#d6d3e4"> <tr><td>
